stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NEW
    NEW --> TRIAGE : issue creada
    TRIAGE --> NEEDS_INFO : falta informacion
    NEEDS_INFO --> TRIAGE : respuesta humana
    TRIAGE --> SPEC_REVIEW : alcance suficiente
    SPEC_REVIEW --> SPEC_QUESTIONS : ambiguedad detectada
    SPEC_QUESTIONS --> HUMAN_ANSWER : preguntas publicadas
    HUMAN_ANSWER --> SPEC_REVIEW : respuesta recibida
    SPEC_REVIEW --> SPEC_READY : sin bloqueos
    SPEC_READY --> SPEC_APPROVED : aprobacion humana
    SPEC_APPROVED --> IN_PROGRESS : job autorizado
    IN_PROGRESS --> BLOCKED : dependencia o decision pendiente
    BLOCKED --> IN_PROGRESS : desbloqueada
    IN_PROGRESS --> REVIEW : MR listo
    REVIEW --> CHANGES_REQUESTED : hallazgos
    CHANGES_REQUESTED --> IN_PROGRESS : corregir
    REVIEW --> VALIDATION : gates verdes
    VALIDATION --> CHANGES_REQUESTED : rechazo humano
    VALIDATION --> READY_TO_MERGE : aprobacion
    READY_TO_MERGE --> MERGED : merge autorizado
    MERGED --> RELEASED : deploy verificado
    RELEASED --> CLOSED : cierre
    TRIAGE --> CLOSED : cancelada o duplicada
    note right of BLOCKED
      Reanudacion: decision humana,
      dependencia resuelta o timeout.
      La regla exacta queda pendiente.
    end note
    note right of CLOSED
      Reapertura y duplicado:
      transiciones pendientes de definir.
    end note
